00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:07.830
If there's someone who's pulling more than
3% and you do think they should get out right

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.610
now, tell me who and tell me why.

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:15.430
And if you think that there is someone who
isn't doing well, but as soon as they get

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:20.370
